        "link": "https://pasteur-lille.fr/en/disease-fact-sheets/typhoid-fever/",
        "snippet": "Symptoms of typhoid fever Digestive: abdominal pain (right iliac fossa), vomiting, bloating, \"melon juice\" diarrhea (especially in children) or more often constipation (especially in adults); Neurological: drowsiness, prostration, obnubilation (“tuphos”);",
        "source": "Constipation",
        "source_icon": "https://encrypted-tbn3.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url=https://pasteur-lille.fr&client=AIM&size=128&type=FAVICON&fallback_opts=TYPE,SIZE,URL"
